      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread potato wedges in a single layer on a baking sheet and coat with olive oil. Mix onion powder, chili powder, garlic powder, and garlic salt in a small bowl; sprinkle over potatoes and toss to coat evenly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in preheated oven until potatoes are tender, 30 to 35 minutes. Season with salt and black pepper.",
